WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.099 --> 00:00:05.253
The Nails of Retribution all across Teyvat started acting up lately

00:00:05.459 --> 00:00:08.363
Feel like something bad's on the horizon...

00:00:08.697 --> 00:00:11.137
Connecting to Celestia...

00:00:11.454 --> 00:00:13.957
Connecting to Celestia...

00:00:20.705 --> 00:00:24.400
Welcome... to the... world...

00:00:25.135 --> 00:00:27.613
As witnessed by the Ruler of Death

00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:33.203
The Holy Soil phenomenon is currently in effect, triggered by the Embryonic-Ichoric-Telluric-Rudiment

00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:38.158
Make way for the birth of a new, manageable civilization

00:00:38.227 --> 00:00:40.524
Testing is already underway

00:00:40.527 --> 00:00:42.361
And we've dedicated every available resource to the project

00:00:42.361 --> 00:00:45.082
But factoring in time for troubleshooting and final application...

00:00:45.082 --> 00:00:47.632
We'll need another two months

00:00:47.632 --> 00:00:50.456
So it really came to this...

00:00:50.456 --> 00:00:54.548
I may not have experienced the destruction of the golden realm directly

00:00:54.548 --> 00:00:58.601
But I am better acquainted than anyone with the rubble and ruins of that era

00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:01.922
Time until Holy Soil phenomenon is accelerated:

00:01:02.111 --> 00:01:03.425
30 days

00:01:03.448 --> 00:01:04.747
Monsters aside...

00:01:04.747 --> 00:01:06.846
A strange zone has also appeared nearby

00:01:07.162 --> 00:01:07.832
In which, everything seems to...

00:01:07.832 --> 00:01:09.697
Evaporate...

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:10.980
Nothing is left behind

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:12.055
Dead

00:01:12.055 --> 00:01:14.001
Or alive...

00:01:14.486 --> 00:01:21.234
As the final punishment Celestia imposes upon a transgressing civilization

00:01:21.238 --> 00:01:26.738
Everything is to be reset to Teyvat's original state — that is to say, the Light Realm

00:01:26.976 --> 00:01:30.291
All the eye can see is erased from existence in the process

00:01:30.597 --> 00:01:33.360
Nothing is left behind

00:01:33.632 --> 00:01:35.406
I promised Lumine

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:37.988
That we would meet again at the end of this journey...

00:01:38.916 --> 00:01:41.411
I don't want that to be in the ruins of a broken world

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:45.089
As mortals, we can't leave all our problems

00:01:45.141 --> 00:01:48.279
For the gods to solve

00:01:48.521 --> 00:01:52.151
I will be there at the front, shielding all that I can

00:01:58.411 --> 00:01:59.283
Thunder run

00:02:00.176 --> 00:02:01.079
Punching through

00:02:01.946 --> 00:02:03.319
Heavy snow ahead

00:02:06.704 --> 00:02:10.476
The Nail of Retribution contains a terrifying power within it

00:02:10.727 --> 00:02:12.303
One misstep

00:02:12.307 --> 00:02:14.897
And we could trigger an even worse disaster

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.054
Rapid catalysis!

00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:26.565
Time for a stress test!

00:02:32.014 --> 00:02:35.506
You hold the lives of all humanity ransom, and their homelands

00:02:35.942 --> 00:02:40.064
All to test whether or not we will still obey...

00:02:40.551 --> 00:02:44.226
Checking Trial of Usurpation completion status...

00:02:45.137 --> 00:02:48.275
I will tell the Heavenly Principles

00:02:48.275 --> 00:02:51.051
That the people of Natlan must live to see a new day

00:02:51.051 --> 00:02:54.004
I have absolved the Fontainians of their sins...

00:02:54.004 --> 00:02:56.991
The Heavenly Principles has no right to cast down the death sentence upon them

00:02:56.995 --> 00:03:00.702
Delineating choices along the lines of right or wrong isn't important

00:03:00.702 --> 00:03:05.180
Exploring those divergences is what led us to this point

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:09.315
External target detected entering processing area

00:03:09.315 --> 00:03:11.077
Trial in progress

00:03:11.077 --> 00:03:13.826
What does freedom really mean

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:16.395
When demanded of you by a god?

00:03:16.684 --> 00:03:20.151
Detected... Error... Error...

00:03:20.858 --> 00:03:22.395
The final contract, too

00:03:23.263 --> 00:03:25.111
Must now be fulfilled

00:03:26.383 --> 00:03:30.317
Even you do not know what love is

00:03:30.735 --> 00:03:31.849
Phanes

00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:34.249
I told you I love this world

00:03:34.517 --> 00:03:36.814
You've flagrantly misrepresented my terms!

00:03:36.814 --> 00:03:39.922
The Eternity paradigm has been overturned

00:03:39.922 --> 00:03:43.626
Does this constitute a rejection of the Heavenly Principles' plan?

00:03:43.626 --> 00:03:47.161
I come to answer for eternity

00:03:49.216 --> 00:03:54.418
Celestia welcomes you

